Available API Endpoints
Authentication (/api/v1/auth)
POST /api/v1/auth/register - User registration
POST /api/v1/auth/login - User login
POST /api/v1/auth/logout - User logout
POST /api/v1/auth/refresh - Refresh access token
Documents (/api/v1/documents)
POST /api/v1/documents/upload - Upload PDF document
GET /api/v1/documents/ - List user's documents
GET /api/v1/documents/{id} - Get document details
GET /api/v1/documents/{id}/status - Get processing status
DELETE /api/v1/documents/{id} - Delete document
POST /api/v1/documents/{id}/summary - Generate AI summary (temporarily disabled)
GET /api/v1/documents/{id}/report - Download PDF report (temporarily disabled)
Search (/api/v1/search)
POST /api/v1/search/semantic - Semantic search with RAG
POST /api/v1/search/hybrid - Hybrid search (keyword + semantic)
Chat (/api/v1/chat)
POST /api/v1/chat/completions - Chat with documents using RAG
Extraction (/api/v1/extraction)
POST /api/v1/extraction/structured - Extract structured data from documents
Reports (/api/v1/reports)
GET /api/v1/reports/document/{id} - Get document report